# Force LF line endings on checkout, regardless of the checking-out
# platform's core.autocrlf setting. Everything in this repo either runs
# inside a Linux container (shell scripts, Dockerfiles) or is parsed by
# tools that don't tolerate CRLF well (Makefile recipes, SQL migrations)
# -- a Windows checkout silently converting these to CRLF breaks them at
# runtime, not at diff time, which is a nasty thing to debug blind.
* text=auto eol=lf
